NAME
    osarch-update - materialize and select current OS/architecture command roots

SYNOPSIS
    osarch-update

DESCRIPTION
    osarch-update detects the normalized operating system and architecture using
    the m os/architecture facility.

    For supported combinations it ensures the corresponding sys, ext and ai
    platform-specific bin directories exist and updates the selector symlinks:
        bin/sys-osarch
        bin/ext-osarch
        bin/ai-osarch

    Current normalized operating systems are linux, macos and windows. Current
    normalized architectures are x86_64 and arm64.

    Existing non-symlink objects at selector paths are not overwritten.

EXIT STATUS
    0   Platform directories and selectors were updated.
    Non-zero status indicates unsupported platform data or filesystem/update
        failure.
